{
  "schema": "neyvia.manual.v1",
  "id": "critique-review",
  "kind": "workflow",
  "schemas": {
    "neyvia.workflow.check": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "manual": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "hill-climb",
            "creativity",
            "critique-review",
            "efficiency",
            "research",
            "design"
          ]
        },
        "report": {
          "type": "object"
        },
        "evidence": {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "path": {
                "type": "string",
                "minLength": 1
              },
              "sha256": {
                "type": "string",
                "pattern": "^[a-f0-9]{64}$"
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "path",
              "sha256"
            ],
            "additionalProperties": false
          }
        },
        "outcomeQuality": {
          "type": "number",
          "minimum": 0,
          "maximum": 1
        },
        "tokens": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 0
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "manual",
        "report",
        "evidence",
        "outcomeQuality",
        "tokens"
      ]
    },
    "neyvia.workflow.record": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "manual": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "hill-climb",
            "creativity",
            "critique-review",
            "efficiency",
            "research",
            "design"
          ]
        },
        "report": {
          "type": "object"
        },
        "evidence": {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "path": {
                "type": "string",
                "minLength": 1
              },
              "sha256": {
                "type": "string",
                "pattern": "^[a-f0-9]{64}$"
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "path",
              "sha256"
            ],
            "additionalProperties": false
          }
        },
        "outcomeQuality": {
          "type": "number",
          "minimum": 0,
          "maximum": 1
        },
        "tokens": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 0
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "manual",
        "report",
        "evidence",
        "outcomeQuality",
        "tokens"
      ]
    }
  },
  "chapters": {
    "workflow": {
      "title": "Executable critique-review method: chronological mechanism and measured quality",
      "state": {
        "adherence": {
          "args": {
            "evidence": {
              "$input": "evidence"
            },
            "manual": "critique-review",
            "outcomeQuality": {
              "$input": "outcomeQuality"
            },
            "report": {
              "$input": "report"
            },
            "tokens": {
              "$input": "tokens"
            }
          },
          "inputs": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "report": {
                "type": "object"
              },
              "evidence": {
                "type": "object",
                "additionalProperties": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "path": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "minLength": 1
                    },
                    "sha256": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "pattern": "^[a-f0-9]{64}$"
                    }
                  },
                  "required": [
                    "path",
                    "sha256"
                  ],
                  "additionalProperties": false
                }
              },
              "outcomeQuality": {
                "type": "number",
                "minimum": 0,
                "maximum": 1
              },
              "tokens": {
                "type": "integer",
                "minimum": 0
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "report",
              "evidence",
              "outcomeQuality",
              "tokens"
            ]
          },
          "shape": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "accepted": {
                "type": "boolean"
              },
              "adherence": {
                "type": "number"
              },
              "fitness": {
                "type": [
                  "number",
                  "null"
                ]
              },
              "errors": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "type": "string"
                }
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "accepted",
              "adherence",
              "fitness",
              "errors"
            ],
            "additionalProperties": true
          },
          "tool": "neyvia.workflow.check"
        }
      },
      "actions": {
        "check": {
          "effect": "Validate ordered workflow evidence",
          "pre": "Host owns task measurements and provider usage; report is bounded JSON",
          "returns": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "accepted": {
                "type": "boolean"
              },
              "adherence": {
                "type": "number"
              },
              "fitness": {
                "type": [
                  "number",
                  "null"
                ]
              },
              "errors": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "type": "string"
                }
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "accepted",
              "adherence",
              "fitness",
              "errors"
            ],
            "additionalProperties": true
          },
          "reversible": true,
          "schema": "neyvia.workflow.check",
          "tool": "neyvia.workflow.check"
        },
        "record": {
          "effect": "Persist a validated workflow receipt under the selected task root",
          "pre": "Host owns task measurements and provider usage; report is bounded JSON",
          "returns": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "accepted": {
                "type": "boolean"
              },
              "adherence": {
                "type": "number"
              },
              "fitness": {
                "type": [
                  "number",
                  "null"
                ]
              },
              "errors": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "type": "string"
                }
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "accepted",
              "adherence",
              "fitness",
              "errors"
            ],
            "additionalProperties": true
          },
          "reversible": false,
          "schema": "neyvia.workflow.record",
          "tool": "neyvia.workflow.record"
        }
      },
      "checks": {
        "adhered": {
          "args": {
            "evidence": {
              "$input": "evidence"
            },
            "manual": "critique-review",
            "outcomeQuality": {
              "$input": "outcomeQuality"
            },
            "report": {
              "$input": "report"
            },
            "tokens": {
              "$input": "tokens"
            }
          },
          "expect": {
            "op": "eq",
            "path": "accepted",
            "value": true
          },
          "tool": "neyvia.workflow.check"
        }
      },
      "procedures": {
        "verify-and-record": {
          "goal": "Verify defining workflow mechanism against host evidence and persist the acceptance receipt",
          "inputs": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "report": {
                "type": "object"
              },
              "evidence": {
                "type": "object",
                "additionalProperties": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "path": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "minLength": 1
                    },
                    "sha256": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "pattern": "^[a-f0-9]{64}$"
                    }
                  },
                  "required": [
                    "path",
                    "sha256"
                  ],
                  "additionalProperties": false
                }
              },
              "outcomeQuality": {
                "type": "number",
                "minimum": 0,
                "maximum": 1
              },
              "tokens": {
                "type": "integer",
                "minimum": 0
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "report",
              "evidence",
              "outcomeQuality",
              "tokens"
            ]
          },
          "steps": [
            {
              "action": "check",
              "args": {
                "evidence": {
                  "$input": "evidence"
                },
                "manual": "critique-review",
                "outcomeQuality": {
                  "$input": "outcomeQuality"
                },
                "report": {
                  "$input": "report"
                },
                "tokens": {
                  "$input": "tokens"
                }
              },
              "check": "adhered",
              "save": "verified"
            },
            {
              "action": "record",
              "args": {
                "evidence": {
                  "$input": "evidence"
                },
                "manual": "critique-review",
                "outcomeQuality": {
                  "$input": "outcomeQuality"
                },
                "report": {
                  "$input": "report"
                },
                "tokens": {
                  "$input": "tokens"
                }
              },
              "check": "adhered",
              "save": "recorded"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "judge": {
        "quality": {
          "constraints": "Use an independent frozen host quality judge; self-reported quality is not evidence.",
          "evidence": [
            "artifact"
          ],
          "kind": "model",
          "options": [
            "accept",
            "revise"
          ],
          "question": "Does the outcome satisfy the actual task, beyond recorded adherence?"
        }
      },
      "pitfalls": [
        {
          "failure": "A model writes its own successful receipt, outcome score or token count",
          "recovery": "The host supplies hash-bound local evidence files, independently judged quality and provider usage; invented IDs fail"
        }
      ],
      "frontier": [
        "Executable adherence is necessary but not sufficient for semantic quality. Outcome quality belongs to a separate frozen task judge.",
        "Three paired tasks provide bounded evidence and cannot authorize statistical Evolver promotion."
      ],
      "guidance": [
        "Compare the delivered result with the plan defining mechanism, rather than the name or appearance of a feature.",
        "Attack your own result: record at least two failure paths and the evidence behind each; identify what was not shown.",
        "Verification references actual host receipts. Do not claim done while a required mechanism remains missing or any linked receipt failed.",
        "Report shape: {events:[{stage,data}],result:object}. Required chronological stages: plan, attack, verify, decision",
        "plan{mechanism}; attack{risks:[{failure,evidence}]>=2}; verify{receipts:[host receipt IDs]}; decision{done:boolean,missing:[strings]}. Verification receipts have success:boolean.",
        "Public tool evidence is {ID:{path:task-root-relative receipt JSON,sha256:receipt SHA256}}. Pure host evaluator evidence maps IDs to loaded measurements. Public tool outcome quality is explicitly caller-scored, never automatically verified.",
        "Every data.receipt is a STRING naming a key in the host evidence mapping: for example {\"receipt\":\"measurement\"}. Never copy the receipt object or create a new ID. Public tool callers pass path/SHA descriptors separately; event receipt fields remain string IDs. Use the exact keys the current task supplied, not the example keys below.",
        "Conforming shape example (replace illustrative values, IDs and decision with the actual task/evidence; do not copy its outcome): {\"events\":[{\"stage\":\"plan\",\"data\":{\"mechanism\":\"observable full task completion\"}},{\"stage\":\"attack\",\"data\":{\"risks\":[{\"failure\":\"main output lacks required wiring\",\"evidence\":\"observed source path missing\"},{\"failure\":\"failure case lacks recovery\",\"evidence\":\"captured failed journey\"}]}},{\"stage\":\"verify\",\"data\":{\"receipts\":[\"verification\"]}},{\"stage\":\"decision\",\"data\":{\"done\":false,\"missing\":[\"required wiring absent\"]}}],\"result\":{\"decision\":\"task-specific actual answer\"}}"
      ]
    }
  }
}
